    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d445">

                <pb facs="0768" n="1726" xml:id="pg1726"/>

                <head>No. 4.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Sackville to the Marquis of
                        Salisbury.—</hi>(<hi rendition="#italic">Received November</hi> 8.)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 30,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: With reference to my telegram of this
                    day’s date, I have the honor to inclose copy of a note addressed to me by the
                    Secretary of State informing me that the President of the United States has
                    become convinced that, for causes known to myself and to Her Majesty’s
                    Government, my present official position in the United States is incompatible
                    with-the best interests and detrimental to the relations of both Governments,
                    and transmitting at the same time to me my passports.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sackville.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d445-a1.xml" xpointer="d445-a1"/>
            </div>
